{"title":"The Top Ranker’s Aspiring Writer Life Manual","synopsis":"Seorang pemburu legendaris melepaskan gelarnya untuk menjadi novelis web, hanya untuk menyadari bahwa ceritanya kurang realistis. Untuk memperbaikinya, ia menyamar sebagai pemburu peringkat F yang lemah dan bergabung dengan guild yang sedang kesulitan untuk melakukan penelitian. Apa yang dimulai sebagai pengamatan sederhana berubah menjadi kekaguman yang tulus, mendorongnya untuk berkembang baik sebagai pribadi maupun sebagai penulis. Dapatkah seorang mantan prajurit seperti dewa berhasil sebagai novelis biasa?","alternative_title":"탑랭커의 작가지망생활백서","author":"Chyuleu Hanjan","artist":"Ant Studio, Gesal","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"c00760b0-3043-4e49-ad7e-ee2d87b733d3","number":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"2ef8360e-238a-4122-b801-845e97277107","number":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"bcab96f7-1ccf-4429-aebc-5825df45abe4","number":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"72260d05-98f7-4000-8c77-c6fd264f781a","number":"47","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"20fe8165-0f6e-446a-9aba-9b97135c419f","number":"46","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"3c9f9747-e47f-40a5-86dc-9fb4bf877deb","number":"45","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"2530ee73-898e-40fc-a738-f7274247f61a","number":"44","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"4baa5a34-f184-44f2-89d1-719752b921de","number":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"24d66233-b631-4a39-b8cd-a0d575ec5fb2","number":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"d513494b-209a-4f79-98d9-c18c6dc34fa8","number":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"462b365e-606f-4232-888e-18269bc7ba44","number":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"